<title>USA: Tulsa Cty ISD 3, Okla., won by Dean Witter.</title>
<headline>Tulsa Cty ISD 3, Okla., won by Dean Witter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds said it won $5.600 million of Tulsa ISD 3, Okla., combined purpose bonds, Series 1997 with a net interest cost of 4.3495 percent.</p>
